---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { sitePath } from "../lib/paths";
---

<BaseLayout title="CPO 光引擎拆解">
  <section class="hero-panel">
    <p class="page-kicker">CPO optical engine map</p>
    <h1>CPO 光引擎拆解</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      从一个 co-packaged optical engine 的结构切入：light source、PIC、EIC、
      光学接口和 package integration。每个入口再回到底层材料、器件、封装、
      测试和可靠性问题。
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="page-kicker">Core devices</p>
      <h2>核心器件</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="module-grid">
      <a class="module-card" href={sitePath("/components/overview/")}>
        <h3>总览 / Overview</h3>
        <p>一张总装图：光链路做什么、内部按功能怎么分层、各层有哪些方案选择、系统架构怎么打包。</p>
      </a>

      <a class="module-card" href={sitePath("/components/laser-source/")}>
        <h3>激光源</h3>
        <p>解释连续光如何由 InP / III-V 激光器产生，以及 CPO 场景为什么提高功率、热稳定性和可靠性要求。</p>
      </a>

      <a class="module-card" href={sitePath("/components/pic/")}>
        <h3>PIC / optical circuit</h3>
        <p>看光在芯片里如何传播、路由、调制、复用、耦合和探测。</p>
      </a>

      <a class="module-card" href={sitePath("/components/eic/")}>
        <h3>EIC / driver and receiver</h3>
        <p>Driver、TIA、控制电路和高速电接口决定电信号如何进入或离开光引擎。</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="page-kicker">System integration</p>
      <h2>系统集成</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="module-grid">
      <a class="module-card" href={sitePath("/components/optical-io/")}>
        <h3>Optical interface / fiber coupling</h3>
        <p>把 PIC 里的光耦合到 fiber array、connector 或板级光路，决定插损和装配窗口。</p>
      </a>

      <a class="module-card" href={sitePath("/components/packaging/")}>
        <h3>Package integration</h3>
        <p>把 laser、PIC、EIC、interposer、substrate、散热路径和机械约束组织起来。</p>
      </a>

      <a class="module-card" href={sitePath("/learn/tfln-and-ocs/")}>
        <h3>TFLN and OCS</h3>
        <p>从 TFLN 的 Pockels 效应出发，逐层理解 MZI 光开关原理、控制信号来源、以及 OCS 在数据中心拓扑重构中的应用。</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="page-kicker">Manufacturing &amp; operations</p>
      <h2>制造与运营</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="module-grid">
      <a class="module-card" href={sitePath("/components/manufacturing-test/")}>
        <h3>Manufacturing and test</h3>
        <p>从 wafer-level test、known-good-die 到 package-level BER，决定 demo 能否量产。</p>
      </a>

      <a class="module-card" href={sitePath("/components/reliability-operations/")}>
        <h3>Reliability and operations</h3>
        <p>老化、温漂、热循环、现场可维护性和失效定位决定 CPO 能否长期运行。</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="page-kicker">Industry landscape</p>
      <h2>行业格局</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="module-grid">
      <a class="module-card" href={sitePath("/learn/industry-landscape/")}>
        <h3>行业格局与供应链</h3>
        <p>出货架构分布、光模块与激光器芯片厂商格局、技术路线演变、NPO 量产进展。</p>
      </a>

      <a class="module-card" href={sitePath("/learn/inp-substrate-supply-chain/")}>
        <h3>InP 衬底供应链</h3>
        <p>全球磷化铟衬底供应商格局：三巨头市场份额、中国追赶者、供需缺口与价格走势、原料地缘风险。</p>
      </a>

      <a class="module-card" href={sitePath("/components/laser-source/substrate-epitaxy/")}>
        <h3>衬底与外延</h3>
        <p>InP 衬底如何成为晶格模板：单晶生长方法对比、制造链与外延层结构，以及量产壁垒。</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
